{%- comment -%}
  B2B/B2C ナビゲーション分岐 snippet
  =====================================================================
  ログイン状態と customer.metafields.b2b.customer_type の値に応じて
  表示するメニューを切り替える。

  判定ロジック:
    - B2B顧客: ログイン済み AND customer_type == 'corporate'
    - B2C顧客: 未ログイン OR customer_type != 'corporate'

  前提:
    - Shopify Admin > Settings > Custom data > Customers に
      namespace: b2b / key: customer_type (single_line_text) を定義済み
    - Shopify Admin > Online Store > Navigation に以下の 2 メニュー:
      * b2c-main-menu  … B2C 用（商品カテゴリ・お買い物ガイド等）
      * b2b-main-menu  … B2B 用（卸商品一覧・取引条件・マイページ等）

  組み込み方法:
    header-dropdown-menu.liquid または header-mega-menu.liquid の
    <nav class="header__inline-menu"> ブロック全体をこの snippet の
    render 呼び出しに置き換える:

      {% render 'b2b-nav-switcher' %}

    あるいは sections/header.liquid 内で menu 描画部分を差し替え。

  注意:
    - B2C 側には「B2B」という文字列やコーポレート向けリンクを一切表示しない
    - メニューハンドルは Shopify Admin で作成した Navigation のハンドルに合わせること
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign is_b2b = false
  if customer and customer.metafields.b2b.customer_type.value == 'corporate'
    assign is_b2b = true
  endif
-%}

{%- if is_b2b -%}
  {%- comment -%} === B2B ナビゲーション === {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign b2b_menu = linklists['b2b-main-menu'] -%}
  <nav class="header__inline-menu" aria-label="法人メニュー">
    <ul class="list-menu list-menu--inline" role="list">
      {%- for link in b2b_menu.links -%}
        <li>
          {%- if link.links != blank -%}
            <header-menu>
              <details id="Details-B2BMenu-{{ forloop.index }}">
                <summary
                  id="B2BMenu-{{ link.handle }}"
                  class="header__menu-item list-menu__item link focus-inset"
                >
                  <span
                    {%- if link.child_active %} class="header__active-menu-item"{% endif %}
                  >
                    {{- link.title | escape -}}
                  </span>
                  {{- 'icon-caret.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
                </summary>
                <ul
                  id="B2BMenu-MenuList-{{ forloop.index }}"
                  class="header__submenu list-menu list-menu--disclosure color-{{ section.settings.menu_color_scheme }} gradient caption-large motion-reduce global-settings-popup"
                  role="list"
                  tabindex="-1"
                >
                  {%- for childlink in link.links -%}
                    <li>
                      {%- if childlink.links != blank -%}
                        <details id="Details-B2BSubMenu-{{ forloop.index }}-{{ forloop.parentloop.index }}">
                          <summary
                            class="header__menu-item list-menu__item link focus-inset caption-large"
                          >
                            <span>{{ childlink.title | escape }}</span>
                            {{- 'icon-caret.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
                          </summary>
                          <ul
                            class="header__submenu list-menu motion-reduce"
                            role="list"
                          >
                            {%- for grandchild in childlink.links -%}
                              <li>
                                <a
                                  href="{{ grandchild.url }}"
                                  class="header__menu-item list-menu__item link focus-inset caption-large{% if grandchild.current %} list-menu__item--active{% endif %}"
                                  {% if grandchild.current %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}
                                >
                                  {{ grandchild.title | escape }}
                                </a>
                              </li>
                            {%- endfor -%}
                          </ul>
                        </details>
                      {%- else -%}
                        <a
                          href="{{ childlink.url }}"
                          class="header__menu-item list-menu__item link focus-inset caption-large{% if childlink.current %} list-menu__item--active{% endif %}"
                          {% if childlink.current %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}
                        >
                          {{ childlink.title | escape }}
                        </a>
                      {%- endif -%}
                    </li>
                  {%- endfor -%}
                </ul>
              </details>
            </header-menu>
          {%- else -%}
            <a
              href="{{ link.url }}"
              class="header__menu-item list-menu__item link link--text focus-inset"
              {% if link.current %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}
            >
              <span
                {%- if link.current %} class="header__active-menu-item"{% endif %}
              >
                {{- link.title | escape -}}
              </span>
            </a>
          {%- endif -%}
        </li>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </ul>
  </nav>

{%- else -%}
  {%- comment -%} === B2C ナビゲーション（デフォルト） === {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- assign b2c_menu = linklists['b2c-main-menu'] -%}
  {%- comment -%}
    b2c-main-menu が未作成の場合は section.settings.menu（テーマエディタ設定）にフォールバック
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if b2c_menu.links.size == 0 -%}
    {%- assign b2c_menu = section.settings.menu -%}
  {%- endif -%}
  <nav class="header__inline-menu" aria-label="メインメニュー">
    <ul class="list-menu list-menu--inline" role="list">
      {%- for link in b2c_menu.links -%}
        <li>
          {%- if link.links != blank -%}
            <header-menu>
              <details id="Details-HeaderMenu-{{ forloop.index }}">
                <summary
                  id="HeaderMenu-{{ link.handle }}"
                  class="header__menu-item list-menu__item link focus-inset"
                >
                  <span
                    {%- if link.child_active %} class="header__active-menu-item"{% endif %}
                  >
                    {{- link.title | escape -}}
                  </span>
                  {{- 'icon-caret.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
                </summary>
                <ul
                  id="HeaderMenu-MenuList-{{ forloop.index }}"
                  class="header__submenu list-menu list-menu--disclosure color-{{ section.settings.menu_color_scheme }} gradient caption-large motion-reduce global-settings-popup"
                  role="list"
                  tabindex="-1"
                >
                  {%- for childlink in link.links -%}
                    <li>
                      {%- if childlink.links != blank -%}
                        <details id="Details-SubMenu-{{ forloop.index }}-{{ forloop.parentloop.index }}">
                          <summary
                            class="header__menu-item list-menu__item link focus-inset caption-large"
                          >
                            <span>{{ childlink.title | escape }}</span>
                            {{- 'icon-caret.svg' | inline_asset_content -}}
                          </summary>
                          <ul
                            class="header__submenu list-menu motion-reduce"
                            role="list"
                          >
                            {%- for grandchild in childlink.links -%}
                              <li>
                                <a
                                  href="{{ grandchild.url }}"
                                  class="header__menu-item list-menu__item link focus-inset caption-large{% if grandchild.current %} list-menu__item--active{% endif %}"
                                  {% if grandchild.current %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}
                                >
                                  {{ grandchild.title | escape }}
                                </a>
                              </li>
                            {%- endfor -%}
                          </ul>
                        </details>
                      {%- else -%}
                        <a
                          href="{{ childlink.url }}"
                          class="header__menu-item list-menu__item link focus-inset caption-large{% if childlink.current %} list-menu__item--active{% endif %}"
                          {% if childlink.current %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}
                        >
                          {{ childlink.title | escape }}
                        </a>
                      {%- endif -%}
                    </li>
                  {%- endfor -%}
                </ul>
              </details>
            </header-menu>
          {%- else -%}
            <a
              href="{{ link.url }}"
              class="header__menu-item list-menu__item link link--text focus-inset"
              {% if link.current %} aria-current="page"{% endif %}
            >
              <span
                {%- if link.current %} class="header__active-menu-item"{% endif %}
              >
                {{- link.title | escape -}}
              </span>
            </a>
          {%- endif -%}
        </li>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </ul>
  </nav>
{%- endif -%}
